  ('add-statistics-with-sources', 'Add cited statistics with source links', 'Include verifiable statistics with attribution from authoritative sources.', 'Aggarwal et al., GEO (Princeton, KDD 2024)', 30.00, 'One of three top-performing GEO methods in the Princeton study (+30–40% Position-Adjusted Word Count)', '["ChatGPT","Perplexity","Gemini"]'::jsonb, 'https://arxiv.org/abs/2311.09735', 'research'),
